iterations.reply:
The enrichment fetch is removed. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the runtime rejects any other import. The "approved" extension isn't reflected in the grant, so the component can't import `http-client`. The node's output is unchanged. If the platform team wants the fetch, the `with` clause itself needs to be extended.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{feed-item, classification};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(item: feed-item) -> classification;
}
```

